 "description": "Verify a receipt online\n\nChecks a creator store receipt's signature and returns what it records (the item, quantity, wallet, amount paid, when) with its current status. A refunded order's receipt reads `revoked`: offline verification proves a receipt was issued, this proves it still stands. The receipt is the compact JWS exactly as issued (three base64url parts joined by dots).",
